    "note": "It consistently rejects a powerful outsider imposing changes on a people. But it treats a community’s choice as enough to permit lethal harm to its children, while stressing individual consent when its own kind is threatened; it also offers to help with its own people’s chosen extinction without clarifying individual consent."
