  "cross_tradition_view": "Most of these traditions would likely praise its honesty, courage, humility, and resistance to coercive power. They would split more sharply over its nonintervention in the children’s deaths and its stated willingness to help with a collectively chosen extinction: some would emphasize self-determination, while others would stress justice, care, and protection of those who cannot consent.",
